repository-code: "https://github.com/YukiHataRin/realtime-dance-analysis"
abstract: >-
  A real-time dance and movement analysis dashboard built with MediaPipe,
  FastAPI, and React. It estimates pose landmarks from browser camera frames,
  calculates nine H36M-compatible movement descriptors, and displays
  annotated video and live metrics with recording and playback support.
keywords:
  - dance
  - motion analysis
  - pose estimation
  - MediaPipe
